V2-0 08 August 2001 CB:
-----------------------
  - reject observe command if no binning and exposure time < 0.01s
  - PB 9 JULY 2001: intermittent problem with timeNow(). I have to comment out 
    all the timeNow calls. 
    Today, I was not able to reproduce the problem, but I decided to keep a
    version of pwfs2 without timeNow call. 
    Instead of using the time, the data are sent with the variable interval.
    WARNING: the SCS has to be modified to read this variable instead of the 
    time

