V3-0 24 January 2002 CB:
------------------------
  - Port to epics 3.13.4
  - Threshold in real time: FG(n) is computed with threshold(n-1), aO(n) is 
    computed with average threshold during N frames
  - detDhsInit is now started by detControl.c
  - CB sizes increased
  - aO: replace imageNb parameter with a time parameter, them imageNb is 
    computed from this time and current exposure time
  - add detPowerOn
  - Check wfsStatus in writeWfsToTcs()

V3-1 07 February 2002 CB:
-------------------------
  - Init threshold and rms from the par file in detFrameSize()
  - Bug fixed in detObserveEnd (prevThresh read from CB_FG_CTRL_RECORD_NB record
    instead of CB_FG_CTRL_RECORD_NB-1 record)
  - detInit and detReset: reset to FALSE signal processing and reject command
    detObserveStart if signal processing not initialized
  - Add flip in header of fg and ao circular buffers in order to be identical 
    to oiwfs gmos circular buffers

